WEBVTT

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:14.950
As such, parallel universes
exist not only in theory,

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:17.500
but are an observable phenomenon.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:20.580
The knowledge we will be able
to obtain through such observance

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:23.910
will be of great value to humanity.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:30.910
We continue to research this here at the
Research Laboratory of Applied Physics.

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:38.160
In order to speed up the results, I believe I need
to snag a bigger budget from the country.

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:42.910
--Now, I would like to explain the concept
of quantum teleportation next...

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:46.660
--This version of you is quite verbose.
--Now, I would like to explain the concept
of quantum teleportation next...

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:48.830
Do you think you'll be able to do it, Daichi?

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:53.500
Don't worry. He merely needs to appear
like nothing happened tomorrow.

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:26.950
"AFTERLOST"

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:32.450
"Episode 9: Fate"

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:41.290
Good morning, chief.

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:44.370
Yes, thank you.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.750
Huh?

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:49.120
Sugar. You usually add a lot of it.

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:54.120
I got in trouble at my last physical.

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:56.700
So, you're at the age where you need to worry?

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:01.290
How is the thesis?
The academic conference is close.

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:02.700
I will hurry.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:05.330
Do not embarrass me.

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:14.580
"New message from the department manager."
"Open"

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:16.000
"How about dinner tonight?"

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:30.450
Thank you for waiting. Your omelet rice.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.950
Um, excuse me.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:46.910
I am Negishi, from the first
division of investigations.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.660
My name is Hidaka.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.750
What business do the police have with me?

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.450
The skeletonized remains
of three men and women

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:56.830
were found in the Okutama
mountains the other day.

00:03:56.830 --> 00:04:03.620
The forensic dental examination resulted
in a match with you for some reason.

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:06.290
Even stranger, according to the autopsy,

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:11.950
the victim had been dead
for at least 50 years...

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:16.160
How would you explain this?

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.410
That's what I would like to ask you.

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:23.660
You are the one suddenly appearing
and claiming that I died 50 years ago.

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.500
Ah, no. My apologies.

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:31.410
Since you're a big-shot scholar, I was hoping
you could shine some light on the matter.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.330
I will visit again.

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:41.450
Who were those people just now?

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:42.870
No one.

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:44.830
Oh, the director is calling for you.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:48.290
I'm sure he wants to go over your
thesis before the academy conference.

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:52.750
It'd be embarrassing if he couldn't answer
questions on a thesis he supposedly wrote.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:07.700
"As of May 11, the department manager of the
pharmaceutical development division has been
transferred to the storage management division."

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.790
"As of May 11, the department manager of the
pharmaceutical development division has been
transferred to the storage management division."
What did he do?

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:12.200
"As of May 11, the department manager of the
pharmaceutical development division has been
transferred to the storage management division."
Well, he really loves women...

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:14.910
What a comfortable seat.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:17.370
His turn, next.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:20.870
Thank you for waiting. Your omelet rice.

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:23.870
I omitted the green peas.

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:25.910
You don't like them, right?

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:44.330
The director has been expelled from the
academic conference due to plagiarism.

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:45.000
Huh?

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:50.660
He got what he deserved.
Congratulations on becoming the new director.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.580
And who may you be?

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:13.080
We thank you for volunteering
despite the dangers.

00:06:13.080 --> 00:06:15.790
You all are the hope of humanity.

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:18.620
We pray for the success of Project Noah!

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:23.500
Hey, hey. Do you believe in the
predictions of Nostradamus?

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:26.120
The one where the world will end?

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:28.950
No way. Well, it doesn't matter
if the end comes or not.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:32.200
The very definition of senility from peace.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:35.450
Putting that aside,
congratulations on becoming director.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:38.410
You have power over the laboratory now.

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:40.660
So you two were behind that after all.

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:44.120
We've completely overtaken
Lacuna Chemical, too.

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:46.620
Leave the bioengineering to us.

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:49.790
We've opened a route to
get the materials as well.

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:51.000
Materials...

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.910
Focus on finishing the portal mechanism.

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:57.580
There is no greater expert
in that field than you.

00:06:57.580 --> 00:07:01.500
We were the only ones who successfully
transferred to this universe.

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:04.160
Where did the other volunteers go?

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:08.790
That's why we can't spend our time
worrying about the method.

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:13.330
We'll be saving millions of people
if Project Noah succeeds.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:16.750
To our universe.

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:38.790
We've been researching the effect of
surge particles on the human body

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:41.750
and have discovered a surprising
byproduct in the process.

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:43.290
What is it?

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:46.870
There are children that
manifest special abilities.

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:48.080
Interesting.

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:50.160
I will inform Daichi as well.

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:52.160
He can use this to his advantage.

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:54.080
No, it's fine.

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:58.290
I want him to focus on the portal.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:04.160
Thank you for waiting.
One lunch set A and one curry.

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:07.750
That girl is so diligent!

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.080
Mifuyu will probably become a good wife!

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:10.580
--Next, one set A and one set B please!

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:13.450
--Oh, did you know about her father?
--Next, one set A and one set B please!

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:14.250
What? What?

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:16.660
You'll know if you search on the internet.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:19.700
Thank you for waiting. Your omelet rice.

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:23.660
It's too unbalanced.

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:33.620
You're still looking into that?

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:36.750
We don't even know if it was a murder or not!

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:40.200
Either way, 50 years ago is way
past the statute of limitations.

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:42.580
It's bothering me a bit.

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:49.000
As I thought, our lab's equipment and budget
are the most superior in the country.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.370
Our base has been decided.

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:54.200
We are currently making an observation device.

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:56.450
I will convert it to a portal device.

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:59.910
In theory, we should be able connect
a path to the other universe.

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:03.870
Just, if we do so...

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:08.330
...a giant void will appear in the middle of Tokyo.

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:10.080
That's actually perfect.

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:14.750
We need an immense amount of
information to open the portal, right?

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:18.290
The more people we involve, the better.

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:20.950
Yes, that's true.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:22.120
There and here.

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:28.290
The greater the reciprocal recognition of
the Observers, the greater the opening.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:33.700
Millions of people will seek refuge.
The bigger the opening, the better.

00:09:33.700 --> 00:09:38.080
Even as we speak, our universe
is falling into decay.

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:41.620
Please complete the portal as soon as possible.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.370
Thank you.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:00.540
No problem.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.200
I hate summer.

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:08.000
Me, too.

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:19.410
Mr. Daichi, I have read your thesis.

00:10:19.410 --> 00:10:23.620
This device is to observe
parallel universes, right?

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:25.910
Yes, once it is complete.

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:28.000
However, according to your thesis,

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:33.870
there is a possibility of
interacting as well observing.

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:36.870
This could be converted to military use.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:41.410
Eiji. Science can become poison or
medicine depending on how it is used.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:45.040
Of course! If we succeed,
we will be the first in the world!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.580
Let us continue!

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:50.790
Increase the pace of our human experimentation.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:54.160
Huh? But there have already
been three this month.

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:58.330
We need humans that aren't
affected by the surge particles.

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:03.120
They must be able to move freely through
the portal without losing their memories.

00:11:03.120 --> 00:11:06.500
I understand. I will speak with the principal.

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:17.540
Oh. No worries. I live close by.

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:19.950
I will take you.

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:23.250
Sorry for the trouble.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:32.080
Um...

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:35.580
You are researching parallel universes, right?

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:36.870
That's right.

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:38.910
What are parallel universes?

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:43.620
Does it mean there is another
me in another place?

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:44.540
Yes.

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:46.620
And universes where I don't exist?

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:49.700
That is a possibility.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:53.000
And we can see such universes?

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:55.700
Eventually, in the near future.

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:00.790
I'd love to see.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:07.040
Oh, this is it. Thank you very much.

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:21.540
"Why are you still alive?"

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:23.040
"High Speed Bus Rollover Wreck"
"All Passengers Deceased"

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:33.370
It's like this every year.

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:36.700
Every time the day of the accident draws near.

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:39.660
I was sickly as a child.

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:44.660
My father drove many strenuous
hours to pay for my hospital bills.

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:51.700
That's why, in a way, those words are true.

00:12:51.700 --> 00:13:00.250
If there are parallel universes, I'd like
to see one where I was never born.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:07.410
I'd love to see my father proudly
doing his job even now.

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:03.000
Hey, hey! Where will we have the wedding?

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.160
At a chapel?

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:06.290
I'd love a place where we can see the sea.

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:07.580
Then, let's go to Hawaii.

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:09.250
What a great idea!

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:47.700
Is the portal device still not finished?

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:51.620
You should have been able to finish it already.

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:53.910
It's not that simple.

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:59.000
Are you starting to have
feelings for this universe?

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.580
No way.

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:03.250
Then, what about that woman?

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:05.200
Of course, you know.

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:10.250
Just what it means to involve yourself
with a human from this universe.

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:12.540
I believe in you.

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:16.040
That you are not a fool
that values a single woman

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:19.700
over the lives of millions waiting to be saved.

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:29.500
What's wrong?

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:34.660
Mifuyu. Let's break up.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.580
Huh?

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:38.200
I'm sorry.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:45.700
I see...

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:54.790
Um...

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:59.370
Take care of yourself.

00:16:49.330 --> 00:16:50.950
Um...

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:57.290
Hey.

00:16:57.290 --> 00:17:00.040
Let's have children.

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:21.080
Lacuna Chemical is a company
that is always ahead of its time.

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:25.950
I would like each of you
to take pride in your work.

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:28.910
I have high expectations for all of you.

00:17:30.080 --> 00:17:32.200
Mifuyu!

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:33.750
Mr. Daichi.

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:37.000
Congratulations, it's a girl.

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:44.330
Her eyes are just like yours.

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:46.870
"Higashiguchi Maternity Hospital"

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:49.000
"Higashiguchi Maternity Hospital"
Did you think of a name?

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:52.040
"Higashiguchi Maternity Hospital"
Yeah. What about Yuki?

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:55.330
"Higashiguchi Maternity Hospital"
Yuki... A wonderful name.

00:17:57.910 --> 00:18:00.450
You did something crazy.

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:05.330
You created a being that is not
fully from either universe!

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:08.700
No. She has the possibilities of both.

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:10.870
A human like that shouldn't be allowed to exist!

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:13.000
Her existence itself is a contradiction.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:16.660
She's dangerous. We have to dispose of her.

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:18.370
Just try and do something to my daughter!

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:21.540
If you do, I will kill you both!

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:26.500
So, you've betrayed us.
Have you forgotten your duty?!

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:29.540
The portal device will soon be complete.

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:33.410
However, I need some time
to think about Project Noah.

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:35.450
That's not for us scientists to decide.

00:18:35.450 --> 00:18:38.250
I am a human before I am a scientist!

00:18:39.580 --> 00:18:41.080
Please.

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:44.580
I'm a truly exasperated with you.
Do as you wish.

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:45.950
W-Wait!

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:50.120
But make sure to run tests on the portal.

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:53.370
If you slow down the
research for it on purpose...

00:18:53.370 --> 00:18:56.200
...you know what will happen, right?

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:59.200
Leave it to me. Don't worry.

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:07.000
"Some Years Later"

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.330
"The entire facility is undergoing
maintenance today. Entrance is prohibited."

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:15.700
I'm sorry for all of this, Akira.

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:18.160
Go back to Yuki.

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:31.040
It is finally time.

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:32.200
Yes.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.290
The safety devices are operational.

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:44.660
It should be fine.

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:50.540
In order to prevent them from using it
for evil, I have to confirm my hypothesis.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:52.660
That is the reason for this test.

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:10.580
Wh-What?!

00:20:12.000 --> 00:20:14.040
All the safety devices...

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:15.000
Impossible!

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:16.870
Shit! It was him!

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:24.370
This is bad.

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:26.580
At this rate, it'll surpass the critical state!

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:33.750
Yuki.

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.120
Souma.

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:41.540
Miss Yuki!

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:43.950
Akira!

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:59.450
Yoshiaki!

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:21.290
In the end, I couldn't save anyone.

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:32.870
But, this...

00:21:35.450 --> 00:21:38.620
This, at the very least, was not a mistake.

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:43.790
There is still a chance.

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:47.500
Reach.

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:05.450
"YUKI I AM WAITING AT LOST"

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:37.950
"AFTERLOST"

00:23:43.540 --> 00:23:46.200
Next Episode: "Decision."
